	B12:
		XA57 ABCDEF 2 Bright A_FadeOut(0.05)
		XA57 GHIJK 1 Bright A_FadeOut(0.05)
		XA57 LMNOPQRS 1 Bright A_FadeOut(0.03)
		Wait
	B13:
